    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "It is rank three. It modifies a Gu Master’s body and forms a horse strength phantom for that person. Under its influence Fang Yuan’s body goes numb as a fragment of the strength law begins to reside in him. That process normally lasts two to three months. With Instant Success Gu compressing the work, the horse strength phantom takes root in about five minutes, and he gains the strength of a horse after he has already removed a boar phantom.",
        "chapters": [
          297
        ],
